        "text": "Sublime Text\nSublime Text is another popular code editor and can be used for multiple languages.\nIt is free for evaluation purposes only. It is also available for all main platforms (Windows,\nmacOS, and Linux). It comes with basic Python support but with its powerful extensions\nframework, we can customize it to make a full development environment that needs extra\nskills and time. Integration with a version control system such as Git or Subversion ( SVN )\nis possible with plugins but may not expose full version control features.\nPython development environments     27\nAtom is another popular editor that is also in the same category as Sublime Text. It is free.",
